 "<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ff7a1a\">6</span><br><i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">has been on TV</i>": "<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ff7a1a\">6</span><br><i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">has been on TV</i>",
